var e={name:"markitdown",description:"Convert various file formats to Markdown for LLM consumption",args:{name:"filename",description:"File to convert (reads from stdin if omitted)",template:"filepaths",isOptional:!0},options:[{name:["-h","--help"],description:"Show this help message and exit"},{name:["-v","--version"],description:"Show the version number and exit"},{name:["-o","--output"],description:"Output file name (stdout if not provided)",args:{name:"output",template:"filepaths"}},{name:["-x","--extension"],description:"Hint about the file extension (e.g. when reading stdin)",args:{name:"extension",suggestions:[".pdf",".docx",".pptx",".xlsx",".html",".csv",".json",".xml",".zip",".epub"]}},{name:["-m","--mime-type"],description:"Hint about the file's MIME type",args:{name:"mime_type"}},{name:["-c","--charset"],description:"Hint about the file's charset (e.g. UTF-8)",args:{name:"charset",suggestions:["UTF-8","latin-1","gbk"]}},{name:["-d","--use-docintel"],description:"Use Azure Document Intelligence to extract text"},{name:["-e","--endpoint"],description:"Document Intelligence endpoint",args:{name:"endpoint"}},{name:["-p","--use-plugins"],description:"Use 3rd-party plugins to convert files"},{name:"--list-plugins",description:"List installed 3rd-party plugins"},{name:"--keep-data-uris",description:"Keep data URIs (e.g. base64 images) in the output"}]},t=e;export{t as default};
